    "public documentation of the old product, page Configurable Repository Fields, read 2026-11-19 by leg 5a (testdata/vectors/proxy_settings.json): the maximum component age counts minutes, -1 disables the check of the remote and 0 forces a check on every request; the maximum metadata age counts minutes"
  ],
  "rules": [
    "the metadata age applies to maven-metadata.xml and its checksum files of a maven2 proxy, the content age to every other path and to every path of a raw proxy",
    "a cached path is fresh while less than its age has passed since its last check; at the age it is stale",
    "the last check is checked_ms of the row in proxy_state; a path without a row counts as last checked at the creation time of its blob (decision 5.5)",
    "-1 never asks the remote again; 0 asks on every request",
    "a stale path is asked with the stored validators: If-None-Match with the entity tag, If-Modified-Since with the last modified value",
    "304 renews the row, keeps the validators and takes a new one the 304 sends, and stores nothing",
    "200 replaces the blob through ingest; the row takes the time of the check and the validators of the answer",
    "a failed remote and a 404 serve the cached blob and leave the row as it is; such a 404 is not written to the not found cache (decision 5.6)",
    "the case of a closed connection has a proxy of its own, whose client has no connection yet: Go's transport sends a request once more on its own when a reused connection closes before the answer (report 5a, section Findings)"
  ],
